SetVar *result evaluate(None)

GetTableElement tid of API_PARAMS
SetVar *arg_task_id LASTRESULT

GetTableElement note of API_DATA
SetVar *arg_note LASTRESULT

GetTableElement type of API_DATA
SetVar *arg_type LASTRESULT

GetTableElement username of API_TOKEN
SetVar *arg_author LASTRESULT

execute app/scripts/db/insertNote.gcs

SetVar *result *json

evaluate {*arg_author} + 'added a note to task:' + {*arg_task_id} =>*log_text
execute app/scripts/system/writeLog.gcs

end